+	/**
+	 * Column Exists
+	 *
+	 * `ALTER TABLE ... ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS` (MySQL 8.0.29+ only) is a
+	 * syntax error on older MySQL still found on some hosts (confirmed live
+	 * on this project's own production host, 2026-09-17 - see the
